{"ref":"BDB, צָנִיף","hw":"צָנִיף","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צָנִיף</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:5\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.5\">Zc 3:5</a></sup> <strong>turban</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:5\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.5\">Zc 3:5</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (for h. priest) and (fig. of righteousness) <a data-ref=\"Job 29:14\" href=\"/Job.29.14\">Jb 29:14</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">צְנִיף מְלוּכָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.3\">Is 62:3</a> Qr <em>royal turban</em> (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">צנוף</span>); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַצְּנִיפוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.23\">Is 3:23</a> (of women’s turbans).","next":"BDB, צְנֵפָה","prev":"BDB, צָנַף"}